# The GraphInOut example reader/writer is a documentation/demo template.
# Object ids reference the graph-format-registry (https://github.com/calpano/graph-format-registry).
# It implements no real graph format, so it has no ..reads.. / ..writes.. triples.

graphinout-reader-example ..has type.. tool
graphinout-reader-example ..label.. GraphInOut Example Reader (demo, no real format)
